    "description": "Training yard, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 183 blocks vs 85 at level 1 (the curb and floor are most of it). Fenced drill yard (11 x 11): a stone brick drill path to the flag post, the sparring ground with two armed dummies and a weapon rack on the left, an archery lane with a shooting line and hay butts on the right; targets, dummy heads and lanterns from L2, the drill master's shelter, lane lanterns and flowers from L3. Not yet builder-tested: carved_pumpkin, cornflower, dandelion, lectern, red_banner, target. Decoration step adds: armor_stand, banner_pattern, item, item_frame.",
    "changes": "Quality check round 1 (\"reads as an animal pen\"). Now 11 x 11 and laid out as a drill yard from L1: dummies with fence arms, a weapon rack (barrels with a spear rail), a bench, a stone brick drill path, an archery lane edged with stone bricks behind a stone brick shooting line, butts at its end; the scattered coarse dirt is gone (one solid sparring floor). Posts at the entrance and the sides. L2: pumpkin heads, targets, a red shooting line, lanterns on the entrance posts, flag, arrow and water barrels. L3: the drill master's shelter now has posts at all four corners, lane posts with lanterns, flowers.",
